{"name":"-32-4-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...A short while ago. Griffin City. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...Dana and Super-Shorty are in a White Knight transport van, wobbling back and forth during their bumpy ride."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hey, shorty... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"...We're here."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What? Where are we?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"m_va_glitch_city","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Griffin City, of course. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Welcome to the last bastion of civilization on Earth, shorty."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I must say...this transport van doesn't have windows and I can't see anything. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How do you know we're in Griffin City?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Of course I know. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The tires make a different sound now. Only Griffin City has roads like this."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Hah..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"达娜","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG-Cybercity","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"night","raw":"Night"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And then there's the street ambience. Can't you hear them? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The sounds of footsteps, talking, electrical currents, music... This city isn't a place that can be experienced just by sight."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Super-Shorty","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Maybe it's because I just woke up, but I can't tell the difference between a city and a desert. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In my memories, humans used to be everywhere. They conquered all the deserts and the seas, and the world was scattered with their cities and footprints..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"达娜","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's no big deal. The dinosaurs did it too, although their feats of engineering weren't as impressive..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Super-Shorty","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Then...do you feel sad, Dana? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I know that humans are...a species that think of themselves as pretty extraordinary... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In a certain bygone age, every human believed that they could carve out a new future before the end came for them... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That they could escape the solar system on spaceships, or sail the entire Earth to another galaxy. They once believed that so fervently, and they were so optimistic..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"达娜","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Heh...you're actually shedding tears. And here I was wondering if I should say \"actually, I don't feel sad at all.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Super-Shorty's tears turn into laughter."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"m_va_reminiscence","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"And you still said it anyway. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not the type to be sentimental. It's just that while I was checking my neural cloud's factory settings, I also went through the attached data on human civilization... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I still remember human languages, human greetings, human table manners, as well as how humans lived in the age when I was made. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It was a great, winding, yet interesting stretch of history. And now, after I woke up, they're...all gone, along with their smiles."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humans will vanish someday, shorty. The trilobites, refrigerators, the entire cosmos...everything comes to an end someday. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"No matter when the end comes, there will be a few humans left behind to witness it. It just so happens to be us. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's all a matter of probability on a long enough time scale."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You mean you can accept everything? Accept this reality?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm enjoying my time in spite of it. I don't want to live for the sake of a historical figure or famous relic. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't care what happens to the world. No matter how bad my life becomes, I just want every second of it to belong to me."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An hour ago you were tumbling down the side of a cliff with your enemy in someone else's car and now you're waxing philosophical, Dana."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Heh, all the impulsive things I do are carefully calculated. A lot of times, instinct and spontaneity are the best way forward. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't plan and evaluate every move, shorty...I just act."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As a Doll, I don't quite understand how you do things, but you certainly are cool enough — Given my factory-set personality, that's not a word I use to describe others often."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Thank you. That's the best compliment you could give me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As a reward, I'll tell you something, shorty."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What's that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You're very cute."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Er... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You do know that I'm a Tactical Doll, and that being called cute doesn't make me happy, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry, but your cuteness is an objective fact."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"An objective fact, you say?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It's as objective a fact as the gold color of your hair."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Are you blushing?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...I-I'm just looking at my hair."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Dana","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Looks like you're starting to accept a few objective facts."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Super-Shorty","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...You mean the fact that I'm cute?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Dana","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SuperShorty","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"lef